<span data-as="p">Customize the logo’s dimensions by adding <code>w</code> (width) and <code>h</code> (height) query parameters to the URL. The ratio of the logo is always respected.</span>
<span data-as="p">For Retina displays, double the size values for optimal display. e.g., for a 64x64 icon display, set <code>h=128</code> and <code>w=128</code>.</span>
